OL,3,ABayeux Tapestry goes on public display
OL,4,Ain UK for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Bayeux Tapestry is going on public
OL,7,Fdisplay in the UK for the first time
OL,8,Fsince it was created nearly 1,000 years
OL,9,Fago
OL,11,FIt's being loaned to the British Museum
OL,12,Fwhile its usual home in France
OL,13,Fundergoes renovation - doors open at
OL,14,F10:00 BST and tickets are sold out for
OL,15,Fthe rest of the year
OL,17,FThe 70m (230ft) tapestry, originally
OL,18,Fembroidered in England but kept for
OL,19,Fcenturies in France, tells the story of
OL,20,Fthe Norman conquest of England and the
OL,21,FBattle of Hastings in 1066
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,162,160,200,105,0,100
