OL,3,ABayeux Tapestry goes on public display
OL,4,Ain UK for first time
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles has called the loan
OL,7,F"unprecedented", while French President
OL,8,FEmmanuel Macron said it was "reminder
OL,9,Fof what our countries can do if they
OL,10,Fjoin forces"
OL,12,FDespite some vocal opposition in
OL,13,FFrance, this is a loan almost 100 years
OL,14,Fin the making, our culture editor
OL,15,Fwrites
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
